nd":"custom"}},{"description":"Bounded public abuse reports (202, no disposition shown) and block or unblock under a separate operator permission. A report alone never disables a link.","host":"link-api","id":"link-api-abuse-and-moderation","name":"Abuse and moderation","settings":{"kind":"custom"}},{"description":"Host + slug via Hot routes, else the Links public view; state and expiry; publish the click and await its ACK; recheck; then 302 with no-store. Otherwise 404/410/403, or 503 with no Location.","host":"redirect-service","id":"redirect-service-resolve-and-redirect","name":"Resolve and redirect","settings":{"kind":"custom"}},{"description":"Required: every route needs a valid token. Each query is scoped to the verified subject, cursors included.","host":"account-api","id":"account-api-sign-in","name":"Sign-in","settings":{"credential":"jwt","kind":"auth-guard","signIn":"required"}},{"description":"Cursor pages (at most 50, by created_at and id) of the caller's own links from the Links owner view.","host":"account-api","id":"account-api-my-links","name":"My links","settings":{"kind":"data-access","readRouting":"primary"}},{"description":"Owner-only counts, ranges, freshness and bounded CSV export. Checks ownership in the Links owner view and the tier's lookback and export allowance with Billing API.","host":"account-api","id":"account-api-link-analytics","name":"Link analytics","settings":{"kind":"custom"}},{"description":"Optional, so Stripe reaches the webhook without a token. Customer routes still require a signed-in owner; the webhook is authorized by its Stripe signature instead.","host":"billing-api","id":"billing-api-sign-in","name":"Sign-in","settings":{"credential":"jwt","kind":"auth-guard","signIn":"optional"}},{"description":"Signed-in owner only: plan status, hosted Checkout and portal sessions from allowlisted prices, allowed return URLs and idempotency keys. CSRF is checked by Session API.","host":"billing-api","id":"billing-api-customer-billing